msgid "MAP145_TRAINER_9"
msgstr "Theo: It's you, PN.  I guess Bamb'o sent you. I'm training to challenge the Venesi Gym, which I guess you already beat. ...Yeah, I thought so. A little while ago, I'd have gotten upset and started crying about that. But... I guess other stuff put that sorta thing in perspective. So right now, I'm just tryin' to make myself the best trainer I can be. But first, wanna battle? Awright, let's do this! S'ok, my Pokemon are tired from their training anyway.  Just lemme know if you wanna match!  They could use the challenge! Oh, by the way, professor Bamb'o asked me to remind you to head North, through that cave right over there. I'll catch up with you later!"

